  "text": "MedlinePlus Consumer Guide: Managing Tension Headaches | Publisher: US National Library of\nErgonomics & Screen-Time Management\nPreventing strain-induced headaches during work: - Position computer\nscreens at eye level 20-24 inches away. - Follow the 20-20-20 rule: Every\n20 minutes, look at an object 20 feet away for 20 seconds.\nPage 3 of 4 | Official Educational Resource",
